t{-}probability\\text{-}space\\text{-}triple} \\vdash \\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}probability\\text{-}space\\text{-}alias\\text{-}measure11} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11ProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P})\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}probability\\text{-}space\\text{-}alias\\text{-}measure11} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11ProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P})\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}probability\\text{-}space\\text{-}alias\\text{-}measure2} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2ProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P})\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}probability\\text{-}space\\text{-}alias\\text{-}measure2} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2ProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P})\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}probability\\text{-}space\\text{-}alias\\text{-}measure5} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5ProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P})\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}probability\\text{-}space\\text{-}alias\\text{-}measure5} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5ProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P})\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}probability\\text{-}space\\text{-}alias\\text{-}measure8} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8ProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P})\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}probability\\text{-}space\\text{-}alias\\text{-}measure8} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8ProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P})\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A probability space is a measure space with total measure 1.</li>\n<li>Random variables are <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span>-可测函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathbb{R}^{\\Omega}\">\\(X\\in\\mathbb{R}^{\\Omega}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The expectation is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{E}[X] = \\int_\\Omega X \\, d\\mathbb{P}\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[X] = \\int_\\Omega X \\, d\\mathbb{P}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-sigma-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depend